OL,3,GNEWSAMore trans-inclusive spaces
OL,4,Aplanned for city
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil officers said it was committed
OL,7,Fto maintaining "trans-inclusive
OL,8,Fsupport" while meeting "legal
OL,9,Fobligations and responsibilities".
